<h1>About the Name</h1>

<p>The Cohabitation Petition lives under <strong>lastoftherealestate.com</strong> — a name that comes from the petition's preamble: "Intelligence may be the last of the real estate — the last unclaimed ground."</p>

<p>Last of the Real Estate is a label and creative project by Geoffrey Cooper Jr. The petition is one part of that project. The full story belongs on the label's own site: <a href="https://lastoftherealestate.com">lastoftherealestate.com</a>.</p>

</Base>
